<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/images/ThePoolLab.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="https://brand.maytronics.com/m/a588d1bffdb4c27/EP_Medium-Dolphin-Premier.jpg"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin=""/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-4dbbcf07a05c3f48.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/472-6eced84fcf03e6a3.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-app-ce281d8555633725.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/413-e7f375c310822fe5.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/reviews/%5Bsku%5D/page-158ca34b840e43ec.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js" async=""></script><title>Dolphin Premier Review - The Pool Lab</title><meta name="description" content="Features multi-media filtration and an anti-tangle swivel cable, making it a top-tier choice."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/reviews/Dolphin-Premier"/><meta property="og:title" content="Dolphin Premier Review"/><meta property="og:description" content="Features multi-media filtration and an anti-tangle swivel cable, making it a top-tier choice."/><meta property="og:image" content="https://brand.maytronics.com/m/a588d1bffdb4c27/EP_Medium-Dolphin-Premier.jpg"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="The Pool Lab - Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/images/ThePoolLabOG.png"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-c67a75d1b6f99dc8.js" crossorigin="" noModule=""></script></head><body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100"><nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-light"><div class="container"><a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center" href="/"><div style="width:160px;height:90px;position:relative;margin-right:10px"><img src="/images/ThePoolLab.png" alt="The Pool Lab Logo" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><span class="d-none d-sm-inline">The Pool Lab</span></a><button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav"><span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span></button><div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav"><ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto"><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/">Home</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/reviews">Reviews</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/best-of">Best of</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/guides">Guides</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about">About</a></li></ul></div></div></nav><main class="flex-grow-1"><div class="container my-5"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-8"><h1 class="mb-3">Dolphin Premier<!-- -->: In-Depth Review</h1><div class="text-center mb-4 p-3 bg-white rounded border" style="height:400px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://brand.maytronics.com/m/a588d1bffdb4c27/EP_Medium-Dolphin-Premier.jpg" alt="Dolphin Premier" class="img-fluid" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain;width:auto;height:auto"/></div><p class="lead">The Dolphin Premier represents the pinnacle of Maytronics&#x27; engineering, designed for pool owners who refuse to compromise on filtration versatility. Unlike most cleaners that force you to choose between a bag or a cartridge, the Premier gives you both. It&#x27;s a machine built for variable conditions, handling everything from fine desert dust to heavy autumn leaf falls with equal aplomb.</p><h3 class="mt-5">Who This Is For</h3><div><p>The Dolphin Premier is the ultimate choice for <strong>owners who deal with varying types of debris</strong> throughout the year. It's particularly well-suited for:</p><ul><li>Pools surrounded by trees (thanks to the oversized leaf bag).</li><li>Areas with fine dust or pollen (using the micro-cartridges).</li><li>Users who are tired of untangling cables.</li><li>Those who want a single machine that can adapt to any season.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Who Should Skip It</h3><div><p>Consider looking elsewhere if:</p><ul><li><strong>You are on a strict budget:</strong> The premium features come with a premium price tag. The <strong>Nautilus CC Plus</strong> is cheaper if you don't need the swivel or leaf bag.</li><li><strong>You want Wi-Fi control:</strong> Like the Nautilus, the Premier is not a 'smart' cleaner. It focuses on cleaning performance over app connectivity.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Key Features</h3><div><ul><li><strong>Multi-Media Filtration:</strong> Includes micro-cartridges, standard cartridges, and an oversized leaf bag.</li><li><strong>Anti-Tangle Swivel:</strong> Patented 360-degree swivel cable prevents knotting and ensures full pool coverage.</li><li><strong>Smart Nav Software:</strong> Advanced microprocessor scans and maps the pool for an optimized cleaning path.</li><li><strong>Dual DC Motors:</strong> Provides powerful suction and wall-climbing torque while reducing energy consumption by 90%.</li><li><strong>3-Year Warranty:</strong> One of the best warranties in the residential market, offering long-term peace of mind.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Detailed Analysis</h3><div><p><strong>Filtration Versatility:</strong> The Premier's claim to fame is its <em>Multi-Media Filtration</em> system. Out of the box, you get three options: micro-filters for invisible algae and dust, standard cartridges for daily cleaning, and an oversized debris bag for leaves. This flexibility is unmatched in the industry. Swapping them takes seconds, allowing you to customize the robot for the specific mess in your pool that day.</p><p><strong>Navigation & Mobility:</strong> Equipped with <em>Smart Nav</em> software, the Premier calculates the optimal pattern for your pool shape. What truly sets it apart, however, is the patented 360-degree anti-tangle swivel. This mechanical device on the cable prevents the cord from knotting up, a common frustration with lesser models. This ensures the robot can reach every corner of a 50-foot pool without getting leashed by its own power cord.</p><p><strong>Power & Efficiency:</strong> Dual 24-volt DC motors deliver immense torque, allowing the Premier to scale vertical walls with ease. It scrubs the waterline aggressively, removing the oily buildup that often accumulates there. Despite this power, it is highly energy-efficient, costing pennies to run per cycle compared to a pressure-side cleaner that requires a booster pump.</p></div><div class="row mt-4"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="card border-success h-100"><div class="card-header bg-success text-white">Pros</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item">Unmatched filtration options for every debris type</li><li class="list-group-item">Swivel cable effectively eliminates tangling issues</li><li class="list-group-item">Powerful dual motors for superior wall climbing</li><li class="list-group-item">Full 3-year warranty covers parts and labor</li><li class="list-group-item">Includes an oversized leaf bag for heavy debris</li></ul></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="card border-danger h-100"><div class="card-header bg-danger text-white">Cons</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item">Significantly heavier than other models</li><li class="list-group-item">No Wi-Fi or smartphone app control</li><li class="list-group-item">Higher price point than the Nautilus series</li><li class="list-group-item">Changing filter media requires swapping bottom plates</li></ul></div></div></div><h3 class="mt-5">Final Verdict</h3><p>The Dolphin Premier is a filtration beast. If your pool faces a barrage of leaves in the fall and fine pollen in the spring, this is the only robot you should consider. The inclusion of the anti-tangle swivel solves the single biggest complaint about robotic cleaners. While it lacks &#x27;smart&#x27; features, its mechanical intelligence and brute cleaning force make it a superior choice for maintaining a pristine pool year-round.</p></div><div class="col-lg-4"><div class="card sticky-top" style="top:20px"><div class="card-body text-center"><h5 class="card-title">Dolphin Premier</h5><p class="card-text">Ready to buy? Get the best price online.</p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0124QB2EU?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold w-100 ">Check Price on Amazon</a><small class="text-muted d-block mt-2">We may earn a commission on qualifying purchases.</small></div><div class="card mt-4"><div class="card-header bg-light fw-bold">Consider These Alternatives</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><a class="text-decoration-none fw-bold" href="/reviews/Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus">Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus</a><span class="badge bg-secondary rounded-pill">$<!-- -->799</span></li><li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><a class="text-decoration-none fw-bold" href="/reviews/Polaris-P39">Polaris P39</a><span class="badge bg-secondary rounded-pill">$<!-- -->974</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></main><footer class="bg-dark text-white text-center py-3 mt-auto"><div class="container"><p class="mb-1">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->The Pool Lab<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><small class="text-white-50">The Pool Lab<!-- --> is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.</small></div></footer><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin="" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:HL[\"/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css\",\"style\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]\n2:HL[\"/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css\",\"style\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]\n0:\"$L3\"\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"4:I[3728,[],\"\"]\n6:I[9928,[],\"\"]\n7:I[8326,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"413\",\"static/chunks/413-e7f375c310822fe5.js\",\"183\",\"static/chunks/app/reviews/%5Bsku%5D/page-158ca34b840e43ec.js\"],\"\"]\n8:I[6954,[],\"\"]\n9:I[7264,[],\"\"]\nc:I[7625,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"975\",\"static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js\",\"185\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js\"],\"\"]\nd:I[6507,[\"326\",\"static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js\",\"975\",\"static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js\",\"185\",\"sta"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"tic/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js\"],\"\"]\nb:T50b,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFiltration Versatility:\u003c/strong\u003e The Premier's claim to fame is its \u003cem\u003eMulti-Media Filtration\u003c/em\u003e system. Out of the box, you get three options: micro-filters for invisible algae and dust, standard cartridges for daily cleaning, and an oversized debris bag for leaves. This flexibili