],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003eThe Dolphin Premier is the ultimate choice for \u003cstrong\u003eowners who deal with varying types of debris\u003c/strong\u003e throughout the year. It's particularly well-suited for:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003ePools surrounded by trees (thanks to the oversized leaf bag).\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAreas with fine dust or pollen (using the micro-cartridges).\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eUsers who are tired of untangling cables.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eThose who want a single machine that can adapt to any season.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"}}]],[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Who Should Skip It\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003eConsider looking elsewhere if:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eYou are on a strict budget:\u003c/strong\u003e The premium features come with a premium price tag. The \u003cstrong\u003eNautilus CC Plus\u003c/strong\u003e is cheaper if you don't need the swivel or leaf bag.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eYou want Wi-Fi control:\u003c/strong\u003e Like the Nautilus, the Premier is not a 'smart' cleaner. It focuses on cleaning performance over app connectivity.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"}}]],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Key Features\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMulti-Media Filtration:\u003c/strong\u003e Includes micro-cartridges, standard cartridges, and an oversized leaf bag.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAnti-Tangle Swivel:\u003c/strong\u003e Patented 360-degree swivel cable prevents knotting and ensures full pool coverage.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Nav Software:\u003c/strong\u003e Advanced microprocessor scans and maps the pool for an optimized cleaning path.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDual DC Motors:\u003c/strong\u003e Provides powerful suction and wall-climbing torque while reducing energy consumption by 90%.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3-Year Warranty:\u003c/strong\u003e One of the best warranties in the residential market, offering long-term peace of mind.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"}}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Detailed Analysis\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$b\"}}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"row mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-md-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card border-success h-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-success text-white\",\"children\":\"Pros\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Unmatched filtration options for every debris type\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Swivel cable effectively eliminates tangling issues\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Powerful dual motors for superior wall climbing\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Full 3-year warranty covers parts and labor\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Includes an oversized leaf bag for heavy debris\"}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-md-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card border-danger h-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-danger text-white\",\"children\":\"Cons\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Significantly heavier than other models\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"No Wi-Fi or smartphone app control\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Higher price point than the Nautilus series\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Changing filter media requires swapping bottom plates\"}]]}]]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Final Verdict\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The Dolphin Premier is a filtration beast. If your pool faces a barrage of leaves in the fall and fine pollen in the spring, this is the only robot you should consider. The inclusion of the anti-tangle swivel solves the single biggest complaint about robotic cleaners. While it lacks 'smart' features, its mechanical intelligence and brute cleaning force make it a superior choice for maintaining a pristine pool year-round.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-lg-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card sticky-top\",\"style\":{\"top\":\"20px\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-body text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h5\",null,{\"className\":\"card-title\",\"children\":\"Dolphin Premier\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"card-text\",\"children\":\"Ready to buy? Get the best price online.\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0124QB2EU?tag=scorpiusllc-20\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"className\":\"btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold w-100 \",\"children\":\"Check Price on Amazon\"}],[\"$\",\"small\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted d-block mt-2\",\"children\":\"We may earn a commission on qualifying purchases.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-light fw-bold\",\"children\":\"Consider These Alternatives\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{\"href\":\"/reviews/Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus\",\"className\":\"text-decoration-none fw-bold\",\"children\":\"Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"badge bg-secondary rounded-pill\",\"children\":[\"$$\",799]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"Polaris-P39\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{\"href\":\"/reviews/Polaris-P39\",\"className\":\"text-decoration-none fw-bold\",\"children\":\"Polaris P39\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"badge bg-secondary rounded-pill\",\"children\":[\"$$\",974]}]]}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}]}],null],\"segment\":\"__PAGE__?{\\\"sku\\\":\\\"Dolphin-Premier\\\"}\"},\"styles\":null}],\"segment\":[\"sku\",\"Dolphin-Premier\",\"d\"]},\"styles\":null}],null],\"segment\":\"reviews\"},\"styles\":null}]}],[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-dark text-white text-center py-3 mt-auto\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-1\",\"children\":[\"© \",2026,\" \",\"The Pool Lab\",\". All rights reserved.\"]}],[\"$\",\"small\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white-50\",\"children\":[\"The Pool Lab\",\" is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.\"]}],[\"$\",\"$Lc\",null,{}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"$Ld\",null,{}]]}]}],null]}]]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"5:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"title\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"Dolphin Premier Review - The Pool Lab\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Features multi-media filtration and an anti-tangle swivel cable, making it a top-tier choice.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"4\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href